    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d634">

                <pb facs="1091" n="957" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg957"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.00/7–545: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 634 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Iran </hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Murray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-05T09:00:00+03:25">July 5, 1945—9
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>459. On instructions of Cabinet MinFonAff has expressed to me strong Iran Govt
                    hope that at Big Three meeting US Govt would work to stop foreign interference
                    in internal Iranian affairs with special reference to parliamentary elections to
                    be held next fall or winter. (Embstel 416, June 20<anchor n="1" xml:id="d634-f1"
                    />) In effect he reiterated Prime Minister’s<anchor n="2" xml:id="d634-f2"/>
                    statement to me of June 19 but this time with full Cabinet <pb facs="1092"
                        n="958" xml:id="pg958"/> sanction. (Sent to Dept as 459, repeated to London
                    as 35 and Moscow as 146)</p>
                <p> MinFonAff also again spoke of Iran Govt desire for early withdrawal of British
                    and Soviet troops.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Murray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d634-f1" n="1" xml:id="d634-f1-content">
